{"id":66642,"date":"2026-09-03T17:01:27","date_gmt":"2026-09-03T16:01:27","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-06T18:44:11","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T17:44:11","slug":"corrida-da-nau","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-da-nau\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida da Nau 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida da Nau 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida da Nau 2026<\/strong> celebra a sua emblem\u00e1tica <strong>31\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> no domingo, <strong>6 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, em <strong>Vila do Conde<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Organizada em parceria pelo <strong>Clube de Atletismo Os Rompe Solas<\/strong> e pela <strong>EventSport<\/strong>, com apoio t\u00e9cnico e cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica da <strong>StatusMarathon<\/strong>, a prova presta homenagem \u00e0 tradi\u00e7\u00e3o mar\u00edtima da cidade, tendo como cen\u00e1rio de partida e chegada a ic\u00f3nica <strong>Nau Quinhentista<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento oferece um desafio desportivo completo e acess\u00edvel, integrando uma <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip para atletas federados e populares, e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de cariz n\u00e3o competitivo pensada para fam\u00edlias e adeptos de lazer ativo. Se procuras um percurso r\u00e1pido, plano e com brisa atl\u00e2ntica junto ao rio Ave e \u00e0 orla costeira, podes planear o teu ritmo com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explorar tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e os eventos de atletismo no <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-porto\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Porto<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: up